{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35360","headline":"题河中鹳雀楼 · 张乔","name":"题河中鹳雀楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高楼怀古动悲歌，鹳雀今无野燕过。\n树隔五陵秋色早，水连三晋夕阳多。\n渔人遗火成寒烧，牧笛吹风起夜波。\n十载重来值摇落，天涯归计欲如何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张乔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35360.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35360","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}